WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.900
Fix a missed clock-out or add time.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.167
A missed clock-out. Click the red dashed block.

00:00:07.667 --> 00:00:12.567
No clock-out. It says when the block started and that it was never closed.

00:00:13.067 --> 00:00:17.800
What. Yard, Loading, Travel, On a job, Unloading or Break.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:22.167
Start. When it started, on the company clock (Eastern).

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:27.533
End. When they really finished. For a block still running, leave it empty.

00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:33.267
Job. For On a job: which job. The hours go to that job's costing.

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:41.867
Why. Why it changed, e.g. Forgot to clock out; left at 4:30 per the lead. The original times are kept too.

00:00:42.367 --> 00:00:46.800
Remove this entry. Takes the block off their week (it asks first).

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:54.767
Save the correction. Save correction marks it ✎. If the week was approved, approve it again. The tour doesn't press it.

00:00:55.267 --> 00:00:59.933
Close the form. The x closes the form without saving anything.

00:01:00.433 --> 00:01:04.467
Add time. For a forgotten punch or a paper timesheet.

00:01:04.967 --> 00:01:06.900
Who. The person.

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:09.567
Day. The day.

00:01:10.167 --> 00:01:14.900
What. Yard, Loading, Travel, On a job, Unloading or Break.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:21.067
From and to. The start and end times. Split a shift that runs past midnight.

00:01:21.567 --> 00:01:24.533
Job. For On a job: which job.

00:01:25.033 --> 00:01:28.900
Note. e.g. Paper timesheet · phone was dead.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:35.400
Add it. Add time adds it, shown as corrected by the office. The tour doesn't press it.

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:40.567
Close the form. The x closes the form without saving anything.

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:47.933
Correct any block. Any block opens the same form: change what it was, its times or its job.

00:01:48.433 --> 00:01:54.033
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
